// ░▀▀▀░▀▀▀░▀▀▀░▀░▀░▀░▀░▀▀▀░░░▀░░░▀░░░░░▀▀░░▀▀▀░▀░▀░▀▀▀░▀▀▀░░▀░░▀▀▀░░▀░░▀▀▀


{
    "$schema": "https://github.com/fastfetch-cli/fastfetch/raw/dev/doc/json_schema.json",
    "logo": {
   "type": "file",
  "source": "~/.config/fastfetch/cthulhu.txt",
   "color": { "1": "yellow",
              "2": "green",
              "3": "blue" },
        "padding": {
           "top": 6,
            "left": 0,
            "right": 1
        }
    },
"display": {
        "separator": " ",
        "key": {
            "type": "string"
        },
           "bar": {
            "border": {
                "left": "\uee00",
                "leftElapsed": "\uee03",
                "right": "\uee02",
                "rightElapsed": "\uee05"
            },
              "char": {
                "total": "\uee01",
                "elapsed": "\uee04"
            },
            "color": {
                "total": null
            }
        },
        "percent": {
            "type": [
                "bar",
                "bar-monochrome"
            ]
        }
        },
    "modules": [
        "break",
    {
            "type": "custom",
            "format": "\u001b[90m  \u001b[31m  \u001b[32m  \u001b[33m  \u001b[34m  \u001b[35m  \u001b[36m  \u001b[37m "
        },
        {
       "type": "custom",
       "format": "Ph`nglui mglw`nafh Cthulhu R`lyeh wgah`nagl fhtagn ",
       },
	{
            "type": "title",
            "keyWidth": 10
        },
       {
          "type": "os",
           "keyColor": "34",  // = color4
           "format": "{2}",
        },
        {
          "type": "command",
          "key": " ",
          "keyColor": "34",  // = color4
          "text": "version=$(omarchy-version); echo \"Omarchy $version\"",
       },
        {
            "type": "kernel",
            "key": " ",
            "keyColor": "34",
        },
          {
            "type": "cpu",
             "key": " ",
             "keyColor": "34",
           },
          {
            "type": "gpu",
            "format": "{name}",
             "key": "󰾲 ",
             "keyColor": "34",
           },
          {
            "type": "display",
             "key": "󰍹 ",
             "keyColor": "34",
           },           

          {
            "type": "memory",
            "key": " ",
            "keyColor": "34",
        },
        {
            "type": "swap",
            "key": "󰓡 ",
            "keyColor": "34",
        },
        {
            "type": "disk",
            "folders": "/",
            "key": " ",
            "keyColor": "34",
        },
        {
            "type": "battery",
            "key": " ",
            "keyColor": "34",
        },
        {
            "type": "packages",
            //"format": "{} (pacman)",
            "key": " ",
            "keyColor": "34",  
        },
        {
            "type": "shell",
            "key": " ",
            "keyColor": "34", 
        },
        {
            "type": "terminal",
            "key": " ",
            "keyColor": "34", 
        },
        {
            "type": "wm",
            "key": " ",
            "keyColor": "34", 
        },
        {
            "type": "command",
            "key": " ",
            "keyColor": "34",
            "text": "theme=$(omarchy-theme-current); echo -e \"$theme \\e[38m●\\e[37m●\\e[36m●\\e[35m●\\e[34m●\\e[33m●\\e[32m●\\e[31m●\"",
        },
        {
            "type": "icons",
            "key": " ",
            "keyColor": "34",
        },
        {
            "type": "terminalfont",
            "key": " ",
            "keyColor": "34", 
        },
        {
            "type": "uptime",
            "key": " ",
            "keyColor": "34", 
        },
        {
             "type": "command",
             "key": "󱦟 ",
             "keyColor": "34",
             "text": "birth_install=$(stat -c %W /); current=$(date +%s); time_progression=$((current - birth_install)); days_difference=$((time_progression / 86400)); echo $days_difference days",
        },
//        {
//            "type": "media",
//            "key": "󰝚 ",
//            "keyColor": "34", 
//        },
//        {
//            "type": "player",
//            "key": " ",
//            "keyColor": "34", 
//        },
                {
            "type": "localip",
            "key": "󰩟 ",
            "keyColor": "34",
            "compact": true
        },
        {
            "type": "wifi",
            "key": " ",
            "keyColor": "34",
            "format": "{ssid}"
        },
        {
               "type": "custom",
       "format": "In his house, dead Cthulhu of R`lyeh waits dreaming",
       },
        {
            "type": "custom",
             "format": "\u001b[90m  \u001b[31m  \u001b[32m  \u001b[33m  \u001b[34m  \u001b[35m  \u001b[36m  \u001b[37m "
        },
    ]
}

